        "vid": "1CH 3:22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Semaaya mutabani we, ng'abazzukulu be ba Kattusi, ne Igali, ne Baliya, ne Neyaliya, ne Safati. Abazzukulu bonna awamu baali mukaaga.",
